## 🖥️ Enter Container

```bash
docker exec -it app01 sh
```

If Bash exists:

```bash
docker exec -it app01 bash
```

Run one command:

```bash
docker exec app01 whoami
docker exec app01 pwd
docker exec app01 ls -lah
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **HOST and CONTAINER are different environments.**

```text
HOST
 │
 │ docker exec
 ▼
CONTAINER
```

