```

Remove:

```bash
docker network rm app-network
```

---

## 🔹 Docker DNS

Containers on the same **user-defined network** can communicate using names.

```text
frontend
   │
   │ Docker DNS
   ▼
backend:8080
```

Use:

```text
http://backend:8080
```

instead of depending on:

```text
http://172.x.x.x:8080
```

> [!TIP]
> **User-defined network = container-name DNS**

---

## 🔹 Network Modes

```bash
docker run --network bridge image:v1
docker run --network host image:v1
docker run --network none image:v1
```

Internal network:

```bash
docker network create --internal backend-network
```

