# 💾 Storage

## 🟢 Named Volume

```bash
docker volume create app-data
```

Use:

```bash
docker run -d \
  --name app01 \
  -v app-data:/data \
  image:v1
```

```text
app-data:/data
    │       │
    │       └── Container path
    └────────── Docker volume
```

Check:

```bash
docker volume ls
docker volume inspect app-data
```

---

## 🔵 Bind Mount

```bash
docker run -d \
  --name app01 \
  -v /host/data:/data \
  image:v1
```

```text
/host/data:/data
     │        │
     │        └── Container path
     └─────────── Exact host path
```

Read-only:

```bash
-v /host/config:/config:ro
```

---

## 🟡 Anonymous Volume

```bash
docker run -d \
  -v /data \
  image:v1
```

---

### ⭐ Storage Cheat Sheet

| Type | Format | Host Side |
|---|---|---|
| 🟢 Named | `app-data:/data` | Docker manages |
| 🔵 Bind | `/host/data:/data` | We choose |
| 🟡 Anonymous | `/data` | Docker generates |

