---

## 💥 OOMKilled

```bash
docker inspect \
  -f '{{.State.OOMKilled}}' \
  app01
```

```text
false → Not OOM killed
true  → Memory-related kill occurred
```

---

## ❤️ Healthcheck

Dockerfile:

```dockerfile
HEALTHCHECK --interval=10s --timeout=3s --retries=3 \
  CMD curl -f http://localhost:8080/health || exit 1
```

Check:

```bash
docker ps
```

Detailed:

```bash
docker inspect \
  -f '{{json .State.Health}}' \
  app01
```

Possible states:

```text
starting
healthy
unhealthy
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **UP ≠ HEALTHY**

A container can be:

```text
Up 20 minutes (unhealthy)
```

The process is running, but the healthcheck is failing.

