# 🏗️ Multi-Stage Build

### Mental Model

```text
┌─────────────────────┐
│      BUILD          │
│ Node / Maven / npm  │
└─────────┬───────────┘
          │
       artifact
          │
          ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│      RUNTIME        │
│ Nginx / JRE / App   │
└─────────────────────┘
```

### Example

```dockerfile
FROM node:22 AS builder

WORKDIR /app

COPY package*.json ./

RUN npm install

COPY . .

RUN npm run build


FROM nginx:latest

COPY --from=builder \
  /app/dist \
  /usr/share/nginx/html

EXPOSE 80

CMD ["nginx", "-g", "daemon off;"]
```

### ⭐ Remember

```text
BUILD BIG
    ↓
 ARTIFACT
    ↓
RUN SMALL
```

