# ☁️ Registry

### Complete Flow

```text
BUILD
  ↓
TAG
  ↓
PUSH
  ↓
REGISTRY
  ↓
PULL
  ↓
RUN
```

Login:

```bash
docker login
```

Tag:

```bash
docker tag \
  myapp:v1 \
  username/myapp:v1
```

Push:

```bash
docker push username/myapp:v1
```

Pull:

```bash
docker pull username/myapp:v1
```

Run:

```bash
docker run -d \
  --name app01 \
  username/myapp:v1
```

> [!CAUTION]
> Never commit registry passwords or tokens.

