# 💽 Disk & Cleanup

## 🔍 Check First

```bash
docker system df
docker system df -v
```

Also check:

```bash
docker ps -a
docker images
docker volume ls
docker network ls
```

---

## 🧹 Cleanup

| Cleanup | Command |
|---|---|
| Stopped containers | `docker container prune` |
| Unused images | `docker image prune` |
| All unused images | `docker image prune -a` |
| Unused networks | `docker network prune` |
| Unused volumes | `docker volume prune` |
| Build cache | `docker builder prune` |
| All build cache | `docker builder prune -a` |
| General unused data | `docker system prune` |

> [!WARNING]
> **Production: inspect first. Never blindly run prune commands.**

