# 🏆 Golden Rule

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Don't restart first. Check first.**

```text
SCENARIO
    ↓
HYPOTHESIS
    ↓
CHECK
    ↓
ROOT CAUSE
    ↓
FIX
    ↓
VALIDATE
```

When Docker breaks, ask:

```text
🐳 What is running?
📦 Which image/tag?
📜 What do the logs say?
⚙️ Which process/CMD?
🔌 Which port?
🌐 Which network?
💾 Where is the data?
🌱 Which environment?
❤️ Is it healthy?
💥 Was it OOMKilled?
🔄 What changed?
```

